	},
	{
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=1, time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=2, time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=3, time=1500},
		{"viewend"},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat050050"},
		line=853,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"I wake up after sleeping soundly through the rest of the night.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"Trying to stand, I find that I've managed to recover enough strength in my legs to barely support my own weight.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kh...”",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"Still, it takes everything I have to stay standing, even with the support of the railing.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Soujin-sama!”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"Kotone rushes up to me as I take one slow, staggering step after another along the edge of the veranda.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Have you recovered enough to walk on your own?”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah, more or less. It's still going to be a while before I can swing a blade, though.”",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Please do not push yourself. It would be best to give your body all the time that it needs.”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I have faith that you will surely make a full recovery eventually.”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I hope you're right.”",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"Even if I don't make a full recovery, I at least want to get to the point where I can hold a blade.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Soujin-sama, please allow me.”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			{
"Kotone holds out her hand.",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Nah, I'm fine.”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“There is no need to be shy. I simply wish to be of service to you.”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"Kotone flashes me a sweet, guileless smile.",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“How am I supposed to turn you down when you look at me like that?”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			{
"I reach out and take Kotone's hand, a helpless smile slowly spreading across my face.",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			{
"Supported by Kotone, I manage to walk outside without my wheelchair for the first time.",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			{
"My body is steadily recovering.",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ahh... Achoo!”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Brr, it has already gotten so cold here in Inner Iseya...”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			{
"Kotone lets out a slight shiver.",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Are you sensitive to the cold?”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Indeed. I would very much like to be buried in a kotatsu when my end comes.”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hahaha, that does sound like a nice way to go out.”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Once the snow falls, this place will become inaccessible to the outside world.”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I hope that we will be able to return to Tenkyo before winter comes.”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If only I could claim Mitsurugi's power, we'd be able to return immediately.”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			{
"Oh, that's right. I should ask Kotone about that dream.",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“By the way, I saw a dream last night.”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Was it a dream about the Founding Empress?”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“No, what I saw was you, fighting at the Imperial Palace.”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You were fighting against someone named... Yagi Sekka, I think?”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			{
"Kotone immediately stiffens, her eyes wide open.",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Th-That was the exact dream I saw!”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Do you mean to say that it really was ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"you",
{"/font"},
" who leapt in to save me at the end?!”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah. At least, I tried to help you, but I woke up right after that.”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“That is what I experienced as well.”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Does that mean we both saw the same dream? Or rather, we both ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"shared",
{"/font"},
" the same dream?”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			{
"A phenomenon like this is beyond my comprehension.",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“It is possible that the Healing magicks I used had the unintended consequence of causing our consciousnesses to meld together.”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“R-Right...”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			{
"I have no idea what that means.",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Could you explain that in layman's terms?”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Your injuries were very grave, and in order to avail myself of all the magicks I could muster to Heal you, I took the liberty of forming a direct conduit between our souls.”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Though it does not look like I am doing anything, even as we speak, this conduit is enabling my spellforce to flow into you in the form of a Healing spell.”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“However, it perhaps had the unintended consequence of melding our consciousnesses together to an extent.”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“This has occasionally been known to happen when the conduit between two souls is particularly strong.”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Does that mean we're always connected at all times, even now?”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			{
"It's as though I'm receiving a constant drip feed of Kotone's magicks.",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I-It is rather embarrassing when you put it like that... *mumble, mumble...*”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“...But the thought that our souls are bound together makes me happy.”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			{
"Kotone murmurs with a bashful smile.",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			{
"Even as we speak, Kotone is expending her spellforce for my sake.",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			{
"And I doubt she would have ever said anything if I hadn't asked.",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			{
"Perhaps it's out of an abundance of modesty, but Kotone seems content to always have her kindnesses go unnoticed.",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Did what we saw in last night's dream really happen?”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Yes. Do you recall how I requested permission to attend to a separate matter once we stormed the Imperial Palace?”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“During that time, I went to investigate the Barrier.”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“That was the place my predecessor's whereabouts were last known.”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“And there, you ran into that Sekka woman.”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Yes. Back then, I really was forced into fighting Sekka-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Knowing you, you must have dispatched her with ease.”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			{
"Kotone's expression clouds over.",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I was defeated.”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“The only reason I am still here is because Sekka-sama took pity on me and spared my life.”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“My predecessor's killer stood right there before me, and yet I could only share in her fate.”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			{
"Kotone bites her lip.",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Why did she spare you?”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“She seemed to take pleasure from tormenting me.”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“She said that it would be a waste to kill me so soon.”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Then she made a big mistake.”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Indeed. The next time I meet her, I swear that I shall avenge my predecessor.”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			{
"The fact that someone like Kotone─usually so committed to pacifism─is willing to say such things speaks to the strength of her determination.",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“That is why we cannot afford to lose heart.”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“For the moment, I will do everything I can to be of service by looking into unlocking your and Akari-sama's power.”",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Soujin-sama, please allow me to examine your body once again today!”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			{
"Kotone declares with a bright smile, seemingly having already put her dejection behind her.",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			{
"This was always one of the qualities I admired most about her.",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			{
"Kotone sits in front of me wearing a focused expression.",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			{
"She's spent the entire past hour examining my body.",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			{
"Even now, her eyes are squeezed tightly shut in concentration as she occasionally mutters things like “Nothing here...” or “Perhaps this...”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hey, why don't we just call it a day here?”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“J-Just a little bit longer, please.”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			{
"Kotone once again furrows her brow, beading with the sweat of her exertion.",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Hmm? What's this?”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I-I beg your pardon, Akari-sama!”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hyah! Wh-Wh-What are you─?!”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			{
"Kotone runs her hands across my body through my clothes.",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“H-Hey! Ahahaha!”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Here it is... Akari-sama, I have finally found it!”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			{
"Kotone's eyes grow wide with realization as her hands remain firmly planted on my chest.",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“M-My chest?”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Whatever are you going on about? I have uncovered a trace of magicks!”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ah, such sublime arcanery...”",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“The sheer artifice it must have required to conceal even the source of its origination...”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			{
"Kotone softly sighs in admiration, as though admiring a masterwork of artistry.",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“...What did you find, Kotone?”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Within you, Akari-sama, there is ensconced an ingeniously concealed fount of magicks.”",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Is that the Founding Empress?”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I have yet to determine its precise nature.”",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“But if we take Soujin-sama's account to be the truth, I cannot possibly imagine that it does not relate to the Founding Empress in some way.”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			{
"This just might be the answer we've been looking for.",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Does that mean you can unlock the Founding Empress's power?”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I can attempt to unseal these magicks, but as we have no idea of their true nature, it may prove to be very dangerous.”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Might I instead proceed with some cursory probing first?”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Please do.”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			{
"We've already come this far, so there's nothing else to do but believe in Kotone.",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			{
"I'll entrust everything to her.",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Very well... Here I go.”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			{
"Kotone presses her open palms directly against my chest.",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			{
"She whispers an invocation under her breath, but in the next moment, it is as though her words themselves thrum through my entire body.",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Aaaaahhh!”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Gh─?!”",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			{
"Though my eyes are tightly shut, an intense torrent of light sears the back of my eyelids with a blinding radiance.",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			{
"As though taken physical form, the light coalesces as a scorching heat in the back of my head.",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="???"},
			{
"“How long I've waited for you to notice me, child.”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			{
"From that same place, a mysterious voice rings out.",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			{
"A voice I've never heard before, yet one that sounds ever so familiar all the same.",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			name={"name", name="???"},
			{
"“Set forth to the Imperial Palace.”",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			name={"name", name="???"},
			{
"“Therein... the fragment of my soul...”",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			{
"My eyes should still be closed, yet a hazy, indistinct vista swims about in my vision all the same.",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			{
"Only once I slowly blink my eyes open does the field of pure white give way to the familiar sights of my room.",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What... did I just see?”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Himi-no-Mikoto!”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			{
"Soujin frantically bursts into the room like a man possessed.",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto?",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			{
"He looks right at me, yet the name on his lips is that of the Founding Empress.",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			{
"Within his wild, frenzied eyes, there burns a vivid emotion the likes of which I've never seen before.",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			{
"Admiration? Respect? Affection? No, nothing so trivial as that─",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			{
"His are the eyes of one who would go to the very ends of the earth for the sake of that dazzling object reflected in their depths.",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Sorry to disappoint, but I'm just Miyaguni Akari.”",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			{
"I crack a smile and a joke.",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			{
"That's the best I can do.",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm sorry. I don't know what came over me.”",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“For some reason, I had a feeling that Himi-no-Mikoto was here.”",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			{
"And so, he must have subconsciously called out the Founding Empress's name.",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			{
"Even now, his eyes are frantically darting around the room.",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			{
"It's all the proof I need to tell me just how strong their connection truly is.",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			{
"That's strange... What am I getting so jealous of?",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Akari-sama, is there anything wrong with your body?”",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm fine.”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“But I think I heard a voice.”",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“'How long I've waited for you to notice me.'”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“'Set forth to the Imperial Palace.'”",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“'Therein... the fragment of my soul...'”",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Did you recognize the voice?”",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Nope. It was definitely a woman's voice, though.”",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Oh, I think I also saw a glimpse of the Shireiden.”",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The Shireiden? The one in the Imperial Palace?”",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Yeah. Maybe that means this 'fragment of her soul' is somewhere inside there?”",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“If we consider this in conjunction with Soujin-sama's account of the past, it would make sense if that really was the Founding Empress's voice.”",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“That would also explain why Soujin-sama was convinced the Founding Empress was here.”",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Well, we still can't say for sure.”",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			{
"But in my heart, I get the feeling that Kotone is right.",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			{
"I can't explain it except to say that ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"my",
{"/font"},
" ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"body knows.",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[160]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Either way, sounds like we're gonna have to pay a visit to the Shireiden ourselves.”",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“But Tenkyo is positively teeming with Republican soldiers.”",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Yep. Soujin's really gonna need to be able to pull his weight.”",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			{
"Once Soujin reclaims Mitsurugi's power, he'll be able to escort me to the Shireiden.",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			{
"If I can unlock the Founding Empress's power there, we'll have so many more options at our fingertips.",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			{
"Soujin and I might be able to take the Republican Army head-on.",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			{
"Or else, we could rescue the captured warriors and mount an insurgency out of Inner Iseya.",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“We're counting on you for that, Kotone.”",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Understood.”",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I shall marshal all the resources at Inner Iseya's disposal in order to restore Soujin-sama's strength.”",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			{
"Kotone silently lowers her head, a look of devoted resolve on her face.",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Soujin-sama, would you mind excusing yourself? I would like to resume my examination of Akari-sama's body.”",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah, no problem. Keep up the good work, Kotone.”",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			{
"Soujin inclines his head to me before sliding the door closed behind him.",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hey, Kotone.”",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“If I really do have the Founding Empress's power inside me, do you think I could use it to bring Soujin's strength back?”",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I believe that would be very likely.”",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“After all, Mitsurugi-sama's creator was the Founding Empress herself.”",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			{
"Soujin's always been there for me, and he's saved me so many times already.",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			{
"And so, it warms my heart a little to think that I can finally be of help to Soujin for once.",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“That said, seeing the magicks contained inside of you has made me realize just how powerful the Founding Empress must have been.”",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“What sort of person must she have been to be capable of such extraordinary feats?”",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I suppose she must have at least looked like me?”",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			{
"Enough that Soujin could stare right through me and see only her.",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What kind of relationship do you suppose the Founding Empress had with Mitsurugi?”",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I can only speculate based on what Soujin-sama told us, but I imagine that the trust between them knew no bounds.”",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Right? Haah...”",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			{
"I heave a sigh in spite of myself.",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“What sort of relationship do you think they might have had, Akari-sama?”",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Lord and blade. Right?”",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			{
"I repeat his words.",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			{
"Those familiar words straight from his lips, attesting that ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"our",
{"/font"},
" relationship is nothing more.",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
